n you bring the insights of science<br>\n      and art closer together with an idea<br>\n      that captures the public&rsquo;s imagination?\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      [Photo: red palette shape with five test tubes containing purple/blue liquid, positioned center-right of page]\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-text\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-col\">\n      The Wellcome Centre is providing\n      funds for developing the ideas of\n      scientists and artists working in\n      partnership. Three to six ideas\n      may be funded with amounts\n      ranging from &pound;5000 to &pound;50&thinsp;000.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-col\">\n      Scientists and artists with an active\n      interest in the subjects of biology,\n      medicine and health (including\n      mental health) are invited\n      to submit their ideas\n      to SCI~ART.\n      <div class=\"logo-circle-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"seal-placeholder\">THE<br>WELLCOME<br>TRUST</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-col right\">\n      For details of how to enter <b style=\"font-style:normal;\">SCI~ART</b> see reverse,\n      or call 0171 611 8289. The closing date for\n      entries is 14 February 1997\n      <br><br>\n      The Wellcome Trust is a\n      registered charity, no. 210183\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-bar\">\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">THE WELLCOME CENTRE FOR MEDICAL SCIENCE</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">helping medical science to flourish</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
